+## API Reference
+
+The package documents 61 public types across 3 namespaces. Package namespaces include `aspose.note`, `aspose.note.saving`. See the complete API reference under Documentation and Resources for members, signatures, and inherited APIs.
+
+<details>
+<summary>View public API by namespace</summary>
+
+### Aspose.Note Namespace (`aspose.note`)
+
+| Type | Description |
+| --- | --- |
+| `AttachedFile(FileName, Bytes, Tags)` | Represents an Attached File in the public Aspose.Note API. Supports traversing content with a visitor. Inherits from `Node`. |
+| `Document(source=None, load_options=None)` | Represents a note document through the Aspose.Note API. Supports detecting layout changes, retrieving page history, and saving document output. Inherits from `CompositeNode`. |
+| `DocumentVisitor` | Represents a Document Visitor in the public Aspose.Note API. Supports starting a visit to document, starting a visit to image, and starting a visit to outline element. |
+| `FileCorruptedException` | Signals a file corrupted condition; derives from `AsposeNoteError`. |
+| `FileFormat` | Enumerates file format values. |
+| `HorizontalAlignment` | Enumerates horizontal alignment values. |
+| `Image(FileName, FilePath, Format, Bytes, Width, Height, OriginalWidth, OriginalHeight, HorizontalOffset, VerticalOffset, Alignment, IsBackground, LastModifiedTime, AlternativeTextTitle, AlternativeTextDescription, HyperlinkUrl, Tags)` | Represents an Image in the public Aspose.Note API. Supports replacing content, traversing content with a visitor, and appending child first. Inherits from `CompositeNode`. |
+| `IncorrectDocumentStructureException` | Signals an incorrect document structure condition; derives from `AsposeNoteError`. |
+| `IncorrectPasswordException` | Signals an incorrect password condition; derives from `AsposeNoteError`. |
+| `License` | Represents a License in the public Aspose.Note API. Supports configuring package licensing. |
+| `LoadOptions` | Configures Load operations through the Aspose.Note API. |
+| `Metered` | Represents a Metered in the public Aspose.Note API. Supports configuring metered licensing keys. |
+| `Node` | Represents a Node in the public Aspose.Note API. Supports traversing content with a visitor. |
+| `NodeType` | Enumerates node type values. |
+| `NoteTag(construction_token=None, Label, Icon, Status, Highlight, CreationTime, CompletedTime, FontColor)` | Represents a Note Tag in the public Aspose.Note API. Supports creating musical note, creating question mark, and creating yellow star. |
+| `NumberList` | Represents a Number List in the public Aspose.Note API. Supports retrieving numbered list header. |
+| `Outline` | Represents an Outline in the public Aspose.Note API. Supports traversing content with a visitor, appending child first, and appending child last. Inherits from `CompositeNode`. |
+| `OutlineElement` | Represents an Outline Element in the public Aspose.Note API. Supports traversing content with a visitor, appending child first, and appending child last. Inherits from `CompositeNode`. |
+| `Page` | Represents a Page in the public Aspose.Note API. Supports cloning content, traversing content with a visitor, and appending child first. Inherits from `CompositeNode`. |
+| `PageHistory(current)` | Represents a Page History in the public Aspose.Note API. Supports adding ranges, clearing content, and copying the current value to a destination. |
+| `ParagraphStyle(FontName, FontSize, FontColor, Highlight, IsBold, IsItalic, IsUnderline, IsStrikethrough, IsSuperscript, IsSubscript)` | Represents a Paragraph Style in the public Aspose.Note API. Supports creating default values. |
+| `RichText(Text, TextRuns, ParagraphStyle, Alignment, Tags, LastModifiedTime, SpaceBefore, SpaceAfter, LineSpacing)` | Represents a Rich Text in the public Aspose.Note API. Supports appending content, appending front, and clearing content. Inherits from `Node`. |
+| `SaveFormat` | Enumerates save format values. |
+| `Table(Tags, Columns, IsBordersVisible, LastModifiedTime)` | Represents a Table in the public Aspose.Note API. Supports traversing content with a visitor, appending child first, and appending child last. Inherits from `CompositeNode`. |
