+## Scope and Limitations
+
+The library targets the workflows listed above. Three specific constraints are listed below.
+
+- Password-protected documents are not supported as input.
+- Output is limited to PDF files.
+- PDF exports require ReportLab.
+
+For requirements beyond the FOSS scope described above, explore the [full-featured Aspose.Note Enterprise Edition](https://products.aspose.com/note/). It is a separate product, so features and APIs may differ.
+
